"P2788632318" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>Rusty! You made it! I knew that you would come to the rescue, just like in the stories.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>The Sorcerer Queen has already reached the castle, you have to hurry before she finds the Sunshine Artist!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2575604170" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>The Sorcerer Queen has found him!<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>If she steals the dream from him then his brother, the Mad Painter, will paint nightmares over everything!<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>You have to stop the Sorcerer Queen and save the Sunshine Artist or the nightmares that Mother sent away will come back for my Playtime friends!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1087674995" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>No! Sunshine Artist!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>Rusty. The Mad Painter uses nightmares to paint your worst fears. I'll do what I can to stop them, but I can't stop them all!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1716349782" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>You did it, you stopped the Mad Painter!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>Unfortunately the Sorcerer Queen took the Sunshine Artist's dream. I don't know if he'll ever wake up again..."

