// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BedwyrDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3646975132" "The Black Queen seeks to open the prison... Even if we could prevent her from reaching Lamashtu's prison first, gaining entry into the Eternal Prison is impossible. The entire Order of Black Knights defends it and obeys the Black Queen's orders without question. Without another way inside there is no hope."
// Answer Text :
"P3298689746" "You've been inside the prison before?"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P3170161464" "Of course, I have walked its black halls for centuries. I know the way to the Gate, but what good will it do us if I cannot breach the walls and their defenders?"
// Answer Text :
"P449114303" "Don't worry, I know another way inside."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - KatieDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3972737583" "Oh no... What now? Man, what is an Eternal Prison and why do you want me to take you there?"
// Answer Text :
"P2385710003" "Katie, we need your help."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P3838324816" "Is that so? Tell me. {Hero.gender=male Does the world need me... or do you need me?|What about me? What about what I need?} Because as far as I can tell, the world doesn't give a crap about me!"
// Answer Text :
"P2860077790" "You're right, that isn't fair."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1442718690" "I just want to belong, {HeroName}. Ok? And every time I turn around more and more of the world I know is gone. Gone! And nobody cares!"
// Answer Text :
"P3259783132" "Katie, I care."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P3746247443" "Yeah, right. You're just saying that because you need me to teleport you to that stupid prison that's hovering in your mind's eye like a storm cloud. Why the hell do you want to go there anyway?"
// Answer Text :
"P3661680138" "Because if I don't get in there, the world really will be gone."
// Page Page4 Text :
"P3199529231" "... Dramatic much?<br><br><color orange>Katie's brows furrow slightly in concentration and then a concerned look grows across her face</color><br><br>...<br><br>Holy crap, you aren't kidding! I don't know what a Lamashtu is, but... The things I see in your mind, {HeroName}, this can't be good at all..."
// Answer Text :
"P2622398430" "So you'll help get Sir Bedwyr and I inside the Prison?"
// Page Page5 Text :
"P4007417031" "I didn't say that!<br><br><color orange>Katie bites her lip, realizing that she probably spoke too soon.</color><br><br>Ok, I will help, but I need you to swear, {HeroName}, that if those Talons make me go crazy again, that you will NOT leave me in that place!"
// Answer Text :
"P1439577186" "I swear, Katie"
// Page Page6 Text :
"P4006953633" "Pinkie swear. I mean it. I am not joking. If you leave me in there I will friggin' hunt you down with my mind, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P769272463" "Ok, I pinkie swear."
// Page Page7 Text :
"P2306006677" "<color orange>Katie studies your face (and mind) for a moment before she nods, convinced that you are being honest.</color><br><br>Alright... Go get ready, and stuff, and then we can go."
// Answer Text :
"P1644896906" "Thank you, Katie."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Katie2DialogTree 
