// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3101790466" "Why did they give up the search for the Black Swan?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2423350389" "<t 1>Intruders!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3956015833" "What is the Black Queen doing here?"
