// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3262757153" "All that remains is the final key..."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1894261516" "Perfect. I want {hero.gender=male him|her} to witness this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P293498893" "Ah ha ha ha!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2573125531" "You can't stop this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3887013373" "I have all seven keys..."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3503860626" "and only one remains to be turned."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P503003435" "And that key is Death..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2705353771" "You will make a splendid offering for the All-Mother."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4113707596" "<t 4>Gladly!"
// Script Variable BOSS_3_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4136338726" "<t 4>Yes, my queen!"
// Script Variable BOSS_6_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3385416190" "<t 5>Seize {HeroName}"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3144188953" "Ah ha ha ha ha"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2378121433" "The Queen's death!<t 3>Was the final key...<t 3>Now... the final key... turns...<t 4>Now... the final gate..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1019130643" "AAAAAAAAAAAAGGGGGGGHHHHHH!!!!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3422292803" "Save the Queen!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4055530382" "She's released her!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P519916095" "Knights! We've been deceived!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1384947313" "Sorceress Serene"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1879674914" "...Opens!<t 5>Lamashtu, Mother of Monsters, Daughter of Anu, I, Serene, release you!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2167961720" "Yes. Yes!<t 2>But these mortals seek to destroy you, sister!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2849606695" "As you wish, sister.<t 3>These insects are beneath our notice.<t 5>Let us leave this place and never return.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P826037087" "Lamashtu"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1197345160" "Rrrrrrr...<t 3>Are you a god?"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P682954706" "Destroy me?<t 1>Rrrrrrr...<t 1>they do not concern me... Serene.<t 3>The only thing I want is to find the Keeper of the Seven Keys!<t 5>And once I have found him...<t 3>Rrrrrrr...<t 1> I shall tear him limb from limb!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P798451976" "Sir Bedwyr... We... We were deceived."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2044928885" "Where we were blinded, you alone saw the truth."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1906234658" "But I see clearly now, brother."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4084072233" "If any should lead the Black Knights, it should be you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1965259705" "All hail Bedwyr, Lord of the Eternal Prison, and leader of the Black Knights!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2338066543" "Huzzah!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P434378857" "The Black Queen is dead, Lamashtu is free, and the spirit of Sorceress Serene was behind it the entire time. The Magician mentioned that there was still hope, but after learning that he is Lamashtu's husband, and she seeks to tear him limb from limb for leaving her to rot in the Eternal Prison, you aren't so sure."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBeginFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2332391807" "So... she is free... I feel her, in the winds... the Fates have decreed that this shall be another mighty struggle.<br><br>I have failed in my task to keep the seven keys, and now the world will suffer for my failure unless we can stop her from leaving the Night Ward. I sense that this is the truth of the spirit, Serene's, plans, however, Lamashtu will be searching for me. Luckily I have a contingency plan in mind to keep her... pre-occupied."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ShadowHunterDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page FightWon Text :
"P3161412100" "You do not fear me. Yet I smell fear on you. Why?"
// Page FightWon SayOutLoudText :
"P2520399291" "You do not fear me.<t 3>Yet I smell fear on you.<t 3>Why?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1617974584" "There is a predator greater than either of us."
// Page FightWonPage1 Text :
"P2466814670" "Then I will hunt it."
// Answer Text :
"P4102399061" "Not if I hunt it first."
// Page FightWonPage2 Text :
"P3818422770" "<color orange>Shadow Hunter smiles at you.</color><br><br>Yes, let there be a great hunt!"
// Page FightWonPage2 SayOutLoudText :
"P877322199" "Yes, let there be a great hunt!"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page TaskIncomplete Text :
"P3409921143" "<color orange>Shadow Hunter merely studies you as you approach him. He looks wholly unconcerned that you are in his lair.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3410839101" "Great Shadow Hunter I seek your help..."
// Answer Text :
"P1879030350" "Shadow Hunter I bring you news of a powerful predator..."
// Answer Text :
"P734215221" "Your Spirit Stalkers are weak, perhaps you are worthy..."
// Page TaskComplete Text :
"P3599186125" "Go, I hunt skulls."
// Page TaskComplete SayOutLoudText :
"P4292170624" "Go.<t 1>I hunt skulls.<t 0.1>"
// Page PraisePage1 Text :
"P3075991462" "<color orange>Shadow Hunter grunts at you.</color><br><br>Your words. They are weak."
// Page PraisePage1 SayOutLoudText :
"P1375139516" "Your words. They are weak."
// Answer Text :
"P2387892969" "Uh... Sorry?"
// Page PraisePage2 Text :
"P934412859" "<color orange>Shadow Hunter growls</color><br><br>You are weak. Like the mouse. You are beneath the bear's notice."
// Page PraisePage2 SayOutLoudText :
"P141925141" "You are weak.<t 2>Like the mouse.<t 2>You are beneath the bear's notice.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P52601172" "This mouse needs the bear's help."
// Answer Text :
"P4238002949" "There is a predator even greater than the bear...."
// Page PraisePage3 Text :
"P1634836329" "<color orange>Shadow Hunter glances at you with disinterest.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3683219297" "There is a predator greater than even you."
// Page PredatorPage1 Text :
"P3960795150" "<color orange>Shadow Hunter's ear flicks and his nostrils flare.</color><br><br>Tell me."
// Page PredatorPage1 SayOutLoudText :
"P3024203095" "Tell me."
// Answer Text :
"P3766765533" "She is a great mother, the mother of all monsters..."
// Page PredatorPage2 Text :
"P1344815781" "<color orange>Shadow Hunter snuffs at the air in your direction.</color><br><br>Yes. Smell her. Death on the wind.<br><br><color orange>A barely audible rumble begins in Shadow Hunter's throat.</color>"
// Page PredatorPage2 SayOutLoudText :
"P4084390435" "*snuff snuff*<t 2>Yes.<t 1>Smell her.<t 3>Death on the wind.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1663952742" "She hunts the Night Ward, but not for you..."
// Page PredatorPage3 Text :
"P4067966939" "Go. I hunt."
// Page PredatorPage3 SayOutLoudText :
"P350212147" "Go.<t 1>I hunt.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2615414759" "Good hunting."
// Page WorthyPage1 Text :
"P2471516072" "<color orange>Shadow Hunter's eyes widen as he looks upon you with interest.</color><br><br>You hunt pups and cubs. I am neither."
// Answer Text :
"P234197700" "Perhaps... Perhaps not..."
// Page WorthyPage2 Text :
"P3636695841" "Perhaps you leave here alive, little mouse. Perhaps not."
// Page WorthyPage2 SayOutLoudText :
"P485490375" "Perhaps you leave here alive, little mouse.<t 4>Perhaps not.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P3488850508" "Perhaps we both die..."
// Answer Text :
"P2910296035" "Perhaps you die here..."
// Page WorthyPage3 Text :
"P3526594011" "Both die?"
// Page PickAFightPage1 Text :
"P3691589998" "Let us find out."
// Answer Text :
"P2145629067" "(Fight)"
// Page PickAFightPage2 Text :
"P0" ""
// Page NotTaskOwner Text :
"P3166431373" "<color orange>The team leader should talk to Shadow Hunter.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3634019638" "Lamashtu is death, plague, and despair, and while in the past I have been able to overpower her, she has had centuries to cultivate her disdain for me. I dare not face her, for she would surely prevail.<br><br>However, there is one creature who may be able to keep her at bay, to turn the hunter into the hunted so that she may fear to search for me."
// AcceptString :
"P1093807724" "Who?"
// SendOffString :
"P1904094376" "The lord of the Spirit Stalkers; Shadow Hunter. He is driven to gather trophies and seeks only the most powerful of creatures as his quarry. The chance to take the head of the Mother of Monsters will be irresistable to him.<br><br>Seek him out in his lair, just make sure that <i>you</i> don't become a trophy yourself."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P885513695" "Seek Shadow Hunter"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3984832047" "Shadow Hunter will not greet you with open arms. He is a creature that respects ability and strength. Prove you have both, but do not appear too strong, or he may endeavor to claim your head for his collection."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1283665555" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: The Hunter and the Hunted</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2366006610" "Hidden deep amongst the roots beneath the Netherworld you find the den of Shadow Hunter."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - PlayTogetherMission 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - OnEnterObjectiveComplete 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - SetObjectiveText 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
