// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - ObjectiveTrigger 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - ObjectiveTrigger 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1436118782" "Grrrr!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P537877973" "Grrraaaaaah!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1377587982" "Ha ha... You are as strong as your words.<t 4>I will go.<t 2>I will hunt.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1500104984" "Darkness take me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P3867566904" "<em victory>A fine kill."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P173644602" "You hunt pups and cubs. I am neither"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1440960026" "You convinced Shadow Hunter to begin the hunt for Lamashtu. Hopefully he will be enough of a threat to keep her at bay."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2670971192" "Yes, I can hear the horn calls of Shadow Hunter on the wind. He will never relent in his pursuit, and thus, my hunter has become the prey of another.<br><br>While she is distracted we now have a window of opportunity to turn the tide and undo the wickedness that Serene has wrought."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - WarWitchDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2220072898" "Whoa, you've got some major spiritual energy clinging to you. What have you been getting into?"
// Answer Text :
"P1553848841" "(Catch War Witch up on things)"
// Answer Text :
"P2216824600" "(Begrudgingly catch War Witch up on current events)"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1961845270" "<color orange>Clarissa Moore studies your words for a hard minute after you stop talking, only then does she speak.</color><br><br>I don't doubt the gravity of what you've told me, {HeroName}, but I'll need to speak to the spirits of my own coven on the matter. If indeed there is the spirit of a Praetorian <i>me</i> doing great evil in the Netherworld, they will know about it.<br><br><color orange>Clarissa smiles at you.</color><br><br>If I've learned anything, {HeroName}, it is that no matter how bad things get, there is always hope. While my sisters have wisdom eternal, it is slow to gain. So allow me to give you some insight you can use right now.<br><br>If there is a duplicate of me, then it goes to stand that Praetoria has a duplicate of almost everyone and everything. Me, you... even a certain <color orange>Book of Names</color>..."
// Answer Text :
"P25842279" "...then I can retreive The Book of Names for the Magician."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P37693148" "<color orange>Clarissa winks and flashes a smile.</color><br><br>I'd go and talk to Mercedes Sheldon of the Midnight Squad... the, uh, Primal Earth Midnight Squad, that is. I saw here around here earlier. Almost didn't recognize her in that little number she was wearing.<br><br>If the Book of Names is around she is the person most likely to have an idea of its whereabouts. As for me, I have quite a bit of meditation and astral communication to get started on. If I find anything out that can help, I'll make sure to get you the information ASAP."
// Answer Text :
"P1481937652" "I'll do that. Thanks, Clarissa."
// Answer Text :
"P971128507" "I appreciate your assistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MercedesDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3765361438" "{HeroName}, Clarissa astrally messaged me from across the dance hall. She told me that you would be coming by and mentioned something about the spirit of her Praetorian self and then something about her coven and a plan involving her spirit trapped between worlds itself in Croatoa.<br><br><color orange>Mercedes begins chattering on about the plight of a spirit, trapped between the worlds of the living and the dead before she catches herself.</color><br><br>Oh, a thousand pardons, listen to me going on and on and here we have a crisis on our hands. No time to play catch up, let's get straight down to business, yes?"
// Answer Text :
"P1479390007" "Yes, the Book of Names..."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P3275458844" "<color orange>Mercedes lets a mischevious smirk cross her face. Obviously she has some very good news.</color><br><br>Not only is such an artifact known to me, it is also here in Paragon City.<br><br><color orange>Her smile fades as she pauses before continuing.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2384757274" "But...?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P92995731" "<color orange>Another smile and Mercedes continues, a bit nervously.</color><br><br>But... The book is currently in the possession of David 'Odysseus' Hill, the leader of the <color red>Warriors</color>..."
// Answer Text :
"P3337795360" "Of course... This couldn't be simple."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P502791223" "<color orange>Mercedes laughs nervously.</color><br><br>Oh... ho ho... Yes, quite, well, I mean to say... it does get worse..."
// Answer Text :
"P2051103862" "Worse? How?"
// Page Page4 Text :
"P4252400837" "Odysseus is planning on selling the book... Tonight... To the highest bidder."
// Answer Text :
"P1073061649" "Tonight?! Who is bidding on it?"
// Page Page5 Text :
"P1914761979" "<color orange>Mercedes sighs and puts a hand to her forehead, as if trying to conjure the names of the individuals from some distant memory.</color><br><br>I've been trying to, well, get information out of some of the more unsavory patrons here, actually, but so far I have no solid leads. You can rest assured, however that it will include the worst of the worst.<br><br><color orange>Mercedes yells a little louder over the music.</color>I mean, you <i>do</i> understand how powerful this artifact is and how much damage it could do in the wrong hands, yes? Demon summoners, necromancers, spellcasters of every breed and creed, even dabbling occultists with more money than actual arcane power. All of them would kill to have total power over all manner of creatures whose names are hidden in that book.<br><br><color orange>Mercedes shakes her head.</color><br><br> I just can't fathom why Odysseus would want to sell such an artifact. There has to be more to this than I'm seeing."
// Answer Text :
"P808494027" "Where is this going down?"
// Page Page6 Text :
"P381195764" "<color orange>A smile broadens across Ms. Sheldon's face.</color><br><br>Odysseus is holding the auction at one of his shipping warehouses on Talos Island. Oh! Wait just a moment... I.. have a... yes, here it is!<br><br><color orange>She removes a slip of decorated card stock from inside her jacket and hands it to you.</color><br><br>The rat had the <i>bravado</i> to send me an invitation to the auction, as if I had forgotten his theft of my family property. I was planning on sending <color red>Exorcist</color> in my place to make a play for the book myself, but now I think you might be the wiser choice to send, if only so Odysseus doesn't link me to the <i>liberation</i> of his property."
// Answer Text :
"P1117169877" "Mercedes, crashing a party doesn't usually require an invitation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MercedesDialogTree2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2614390280" "Ready to crash the party? <color orange>That invitation allows you to bring guests, it might not be a bad idea to bring some backup.</color><br><br><color yellow>This mission is of higher difficulty than normal, you may want to bring a friend or two to help.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - OdysseusDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskIncomplete Text :
"P1263863108" "<color orange>The Book of Names lies on the ground before Odysseus. He is in no condition to stop you from taking it."
// Answer Text :
"P129032452" "(Take the Book of Names)"
// Page TaskComplete Text :
"P2866054088" "<color orange>The Book of Names has already been taken from Odysseus.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4043169263" "Now is the time to counter strike and dash Serene's plans against the rocks of divine justice. The means to trap Lamashtu once more within the Eternal Prison exist, but are beyond my grasp. Already I have begun work on forging new keys for its seven doors. <color orange>But in order to get her into the prison we must know Lamashtu's seven true names, which are unknown to me</color>. Once they were written in <color orange>The Book of Names</color>, but the Emperor saw fit for that artifact to be destroyed."
// AcceptString :
"P1505117157" "Perhaps there are others for whom these names are known."
// SendOffString :
"P3974657606" "Yes... Yes!<br><br>While Lamashtu's names are hidden in this place, the flow of magic connects all worlds.<br><br>Serene has proven a most capable arcanist... <color orange>If you could find her equal in another world she may be able to match her wits and help you discover Lamashtu's seven true names before all is lost.</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2123444885" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: Seeing Double</color>"

