// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3242980842" "Hey, {hero.gender=male bro|girl}, keep it civil in there, ok?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3401747668" "Warriors!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2631053776" "Friggin' Nemesis, man..."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P431087232" "<t 2>Here comes another one, be cool."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P942436319" "Odysseus"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1580130406" "What the? I didn't invite you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4076221781" "No matter, I have magic enough to deal with you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P288813934" "You'll never get the book!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3471376927" "I will not yield!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P2482963464" "This is why I should never invite Nemesis to anything!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P195933678" "No contest."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2877912233" "No... How did my plan fail?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P323325638" "<em=welcome t=5 d=5>Welcome. Welcome to you all."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4159885431" "<em=thanks t=4 d=4>Libri Vermis, Librarian of the Circle of Thorns..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1747342343" "<em=bow t=4 d=4>Hwong Li, respected sorcerer of the Tsoo..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1045495307" "<em=fancybow t=4 d=4>And Lord Nemesis, whose plans within plans have brought him here..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1700565741" "<em=lecture t=4 d=4>Gentlemen, as you know, The Book of Names is an artifact unlike any other.<em t=4 d=4>Within its ancient pages are scrawled the names of anyone and everyone of significance..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1361348504" "<em=welcome t=5 d=5>You must all be wondering why I would be willing to part with such an obviously powerful artifact<em t=3 d=3>Well, the answer to that is quite simple..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3186040507" "<em=shrug t=4 d=4>I'm -not- parting with it."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3966875434" "<em=talk t=4 d=4>I used the book to weave a spell over this place using your true names.<em t=4 d=4>You will find that you are all quite powerless to oppose me."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P187182117" "<em t=4 d=4>And now my trap is sprung, and my rivals doomed..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3892929901" "<em t=3 d=3>WARRIORS!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P521306640" "<t 1>HUA!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1352837559" "<em=dustoff t=4 d=4>Cut them down where they stand."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1490670053" "Libri Vermis"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2666845265" "You shall die for this treachery, Odysseus of the Warriors!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3188540977" "Now that I am free your souls are forfeit!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1993759683" "{HeroName} has the book!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P810432801" "Agony Mage"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P237094283" "Get the book!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2781969827" "Nemesis"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1649468640" "<em=fancybow t=3 d=3>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2213894615" "<em=laugh t=3 d=3>Predictable.<t 3>Which is why I'm not the real Nemesis.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2641097063" "That is why I sent an invitation to Mercedes Sheldon."
