// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2698882498" "This body once belonged to the Praetorian Clarissa Moore, known as Sorceress Serene, but now it holds the spirit of Primal Earth's Clarissa Moore, the heroine better known as War Witch."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1213242656" "You are a disgrace to the Ravenwing, Serene!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
